L \u00a7 1136</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for New York Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"New York\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-new-york/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"New York Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/new-york-tax-deed-and-tax-lien-sales/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "New York Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales", "rank_math_description": "New York tax deed and tax lien sales: who runs the sale, interest, redemption periods and selling before the sale. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "new york tax deed sales"}]